arcade-shelf includes or builds these third-party components:

- The ImGui renderer in src/gl.cpp (its shaders and draw loop) is adapted
  from the ROM selector of PCSX AwO by Rinnegatamante
  (github.com/Rinnegatamante/PCSX_AwO, frontend/vita/rom_selector.cpp),
  used under the MIT licence with his permission.

- Dear ImGui 1.61 (deps/imgui), by Omar Cornut and contributors.
  MIT License, see deps/imgui/LICENSE.txt.
- Roboto Medium (deps/imgui/misc/fonts/Roboto-Medium.ttf), by Christian
  Robertson. Apache License 2.0. Compiled into the library as the UI font.
- rjson and rstrtod (deps/rjson), from libretro-common by the RetroArch team.
  MIT-style licence, stated at the top of each file. Built only with ADB=1.

With ADB=1 the library downloads data and images from Arcade Database
(https://adb.arcadeitalia.net, by motoschifo; most images from
ProgettoSnaps). That data is not part of arcade-shelf: it belongs to its
owners and is used under the service's conditions, which require crediting
the source. The library shows the credit on its download panel.
